      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَصَرٌ</span></b>  [inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَصِرَ</span>, q. v., passim. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also]
<i>Suppression of the flow of milk of a camel, from
a heaviness,</i> or <i>heaving, of the stomach, or a
